lateweave

The batching and SIMD reduction in src/maxsim.rs are derived from maxsim-cpu,
an Apache-2.0 project by Benjamin Clavie and the Mixedbread team:
https://github.com/mixedbread-ai/maxsim-cpu

The TurboQuant-MSE storage implementation follows the TurboQuant algorithm by
Zandieh et al. and adapts fixed Lloyd-Max constants and deterministic rotation
structure from Qdrant's Apache-2.0 implementation:
https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.19874
https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant/tree/master/lib/quantization/src/turboquant

The spherical-coordinate embedding compression used by JzipVectorStore was
introduced by Han Xiao and Jina AI. Lateweave's Rust implementation and
document-framed persistent format are original and are not byte-compatible
with the upstream CLI:
https://jina.ai/embedding-compression.pdf
https://github.com/jina-ai/jzip-compressor

Jina AI's legal repository states that Apache-2.0 applies to its managed
open-source projects unless a project states otherwise:
https://github.com/jina-ai/legal

JzipVectorStore uses zstd, distributed under the BSD license by Yann Collet and
contributors:
https://github.com/facebook/zstd
